  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Having reached 17th level, your aura can become a conduit. Replace the target of a spell with \"any number of target creatures within your aura.\" If you do so and it has a range of self, each target must be willing.</p><p>You can use this ability once and regain the ability to use it at the end of a long rest.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
